    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시를 구한 영웅과 승부를 하게 될 줄이야...\n덕분에 감을 찾을 수 있었습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C2DCB97C0020AD6CD55C0020C601C6C5ACFC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558AC8C0020B4200020C904C774C57C002E002E002E000AB355BD84C5D00020AC10C7440020CC3EC7440020C2180020C788C5C8C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 카페로 들어가시죠.\n커피를 준비해 드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020CE74D398B85C0020B4E4C5B4AC00C2DCC8E0002E000ACEE4D53CB97C0020C900BE44D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 지저분하긴 하지만 상태는 좋네요.\n깨끗하게 씻으면 문제는 없겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020C9C0C800BD84D558AE340020D558C9C0B9CC0020C0C1D0DCB2940020C88BB124C694002E000AAE68B057D558AC8C0020C53BC73CBA740020BB38C81CB2940020C5C6ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼...\n당시의 커피를 재현해 보겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002E002E002E000AB2F9C2DCC7580020CEE4D53CB97C0020C7ACD604D5740020BCF4ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "금방 준비해 드릴 테니\n앉아서 기다려 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE08BC290020C900BE44D5740020B4DCB9B40020D14CB2C8000AC549C544C11C0020AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아아...\n그때 그 커피네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C544002E002E002E000AADF8B54C0020ADF80020CEE4D53CB124C694002E00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코를 뚫고 들어오는 향...\n오감을 총동원해서 마셔 봐야겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54B97C0020B6ABACE00020B4E4C5B4C624B2940020D5A5002E002E002E000AC624AC10C7440020CD1DB3D9C6D0D574C11C0020B9C8C1540020BD10C57CACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마스터! 10년 전과 똑같은...\n아니, 그 이상 가는 커피였어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C2A4D1300021002000310030B1440020C804ACFC0020B611AC19C740002E002E002E000AC544B2C8002C0020ADF80020C774C0C10020AC00B2940020CEE4D53CC600C5B4C694002100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저에게는 최고의 칭찬이군요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C5D0AC8CB2940020CD5CACE0C7580020CE6DCC2CC774AD70C694002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 손님께\n사과를 드려야 할 것 같네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C190B2D8AED8000AC0ACACFCB97C0020B4DCB824C57C0020D5600020AC830020AC19B124C694002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 이렇게 맛있는 커피를 주셨는데\n사과를 할 일이 뭐가 있으시죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0020C774B807AC8C0020B9DBC788B2940020CEE4D53CB97C0020C8FCC168B294B370000AC0ACACFCB97C0020D5600020C77CC7740020BB50AC000020C788C73CC2DCC8E0003F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 커피는 사실\n제가 만든 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020CEE4D53CB2940020C0ACC2E4000AC81CAC000020B9CCB4E00020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D00021003F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 그저 고용된 마스터였지만\n플레어단 사건을 계기로 은퇴했었습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020ADF8C8000020ACE0C6A9B41C0020B9C8C2A4D130C600C9C0B9CC000AD50CB808C5B4B2E80020C0ACAC74C7440020ACC4AE30B85C0020C740D1F4D588C5C8C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 제 제자는 어떻게 해서든\n커피의 맛을 이어 가고 싶어 하더군요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C81C0020C81CC790B2940020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020D574C11CB4E0000ACEE4D53CC7580020B9DBC7440020C774C5B40020AC00ACE00020C2F6C5B40020D558B354AD70C694002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시가 점점 바뀌어 가도\n바뀌어서는 안 되는 게 있기 마련이니까요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그중 하나가 마스터의 커피구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C2DCAC000020C810C8100020BC14B00CC5B40020AC00B3C4000ABC14B00CC5B4C11CB2940020C5480020B418B2940020AC8C0020C788AE300020B9C8B828C774B2C8AE4CC694002E00100001BE00000AADF8C9110020D558B098AC000020B9C8C2A4D130C7580020CEE4D53CAD6CC694002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르에 사는 사람과 포켓몬 모두가\n자신이 살았던 흔적을 남기고 싶어 하는 것과<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n같은 마음이라 생각했습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C5D00020C0ACB2940020C0ACB78CACFC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020BAA8B450AC00000AC790C2E0C7740020C0B4C558B3580020D754C801C7440020B0A8AE30ACE00020C2F6C5B40020D558B2940020AC83ACFC00100001BE00000AAC19C7400020B9C8C74CC774B77C0020C0DDAC01D588C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇군요... 그래도 좋아하는 커피를\n계속 마실 수 있다는 걸 알아서 기쁘네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD70C694002E002E002E0020ADF8B798B3C40020C88BC544D558B2940020CEE4D53CB97C000AACC4C18D0020B9C8C2E40020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020AC780020C54CC544C11C0020AE30C058B124C694002E00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "언제가 될지는 모르겠지만,\n다음에 또 미르에 왔을 때는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정식으로 점장님의 커피를 마셔 볼게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B8C81CAC000020B420C9C0B2940020BAA8B974ACA0C9C0B9CC002C000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020BBF8B974C5D00020C654C7440020B54CB29400100001BE00000AC815C2DDC73CB85C0020C810C7A5B2D8C7580020CEE4D53CB97C0020B9C8C1540020BCFCAC8CC694002E00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네, 기다리고 있을게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124002C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C744AC8CC694002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    }
